# Red words under a moment's line when its sound was removed and the moment could not be set back to its own sound.
settings-sounds-not-set-back = 它的声音已被移除，但无法恢复为自带的声音。

# Title of the card with the sounds for logging in and out and notifications.
settings-sounds-coming-title = 进出

# Words behind the i of that card.
settings-sounds-coming-about = 选中声音时会播放，选“关闭”则该时刻保持安静。每项旁边的圆形按钮会播放当前所选的声音。每个音量以十为单位，从 0 到 100，松开时会播放一次。

# Title of the card with the charger and battery sounds.
settings-sounds-power-title = 电源

# Words behind the i of that card.
settings-sounds-power-about = 插入和拔出充电器，以及电量低时的声音。音量以十为单位，从 0 到 100，松开时会播放一次。

# Title of the card with the sounds the person added.
settings-sounds-own-title = 你自己的声音

# Words behind the i of that card.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-sounds-own-about = WAV、OGG、Opus、FLAC 或 MP3。它们会被复制到你自己的文件夹中，所以原文件可以移动或删除，然后就能像其他声音一样在任何时刻旁选用。移除某个声音后，用到它的时刻会恢复为自带的声音。

